(4340150, 625409, 83313, '<td valign="top">Excessive fisheye views usually don''t work for me, but it does well on this. It enhances the depth of the concrete canyon. How far did you hang out of the window to shoot this?</td>', 'Excessive fisheye views usually don''t work for me, but it does well on this. It enhances the depth of the concrete canyon. How far did you hang out of the window to shoot this?', '2007-12-28 00:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340154, 625785, 83313, '<td valign="top">Glad you threw in a title that makes it clear, or I may have overlooked the connection to the theme. Nice stop motion. Only distraction is what looks lkike a spiderweb under the moth. It divides the frame up.</td>', 'Glad you threw in a title that makes it clear, or I may have overlooked the connection to the theme. Nice stop motion. Only distraction is what looks lkike a spiderweb under the moth. It divides the frame up.', '2007-12-28 00:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340160, 624988, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this just looks like a snapshot, though it is a decent one. It''s also severely cropped. You should use every bit of the 640 pixels allowed, at least in one direction.</td>', 'I''m afraid this just looks like a snapshot, though it is a decent one. It''s also severely cropped. You should use every bit of the 640 pixels allowed, at least in one direction.', '2007-12-28 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340162, 625588, 83313, '<td valign="top">Other than a slight skew, I like this.</td>', 'Other than a slight skew, I like this.', '2007-12-28 00:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340165, 625088, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the enhancement you did to the colors of the ground.  The image as a whole does not have much impact on me, though. It may be that the overcast day just left it flat.</td>', 'I like the composition and the enhancement you did to the colors of the ground.  The image as a whole does not have much impact on me, though. It may be that the overcast day just left it flat.', '2007-12-28 00:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340169, 624684, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice skewed perspective and comp. Great clarity. This has a lot of "Pow" to it.</td>', 'Nice skewed perspective and comp. Great clarity. This has a lot of "Pow" to it.', '2007-12-28 00:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340176, 624307, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is a minor skew to this, the left is visibly lower than the right. I also think there is too much water showing, and the rest of the image is lost in it. A narrower crop in the horizontal direction may have worked better for that.</td>', 'There is a minor skew to this, the left is visibly lower than the right. I also think there is too much water showing, and the rest of the image is lost in it. A narrower crop in the horizontal direction may have worked better for that.', '2007-12-28 00:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340185, 625019, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and subject, though I find the colors a little flat. I think punching up the colors with some curves adjustments may have given it some better pop.</td>', 'Nice comp and subject, though I find the colors a little flat. I think punching up the colors with some curves adjustments may have given it some better pop.', '2007-12-28 00:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340188, 625358, 15690, '<td valign="top">A real eye catcher.  Niffty</td>', 'A real eye catcher.  Niffty', '2007-12-28 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340191, 624603, 15690, '<td valign="top">Great and nioe to see some life in it.</td>', 'Great and nioe to see some life in it.', '2007-12-28 00:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340194, 624546, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ok, you will have to explain this to me! I have seen photos of this in China. Is it on display here in Texas, or is this a replica? I cannot imagine something so fragile would go on a world tour.</td>', 'Ok, you will have to explain this to me! I have seen photos of this in China. Is it on display here in Texas, or is this a replica? I cannot imagine something so fragile would go on a world tour.', '2007-12-28 00:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340200, 625693, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice comp, great colors, interesting perspective, and it features the world''s most perfect machine. What else can I say?</td>', 'Nice comp, great colors, interesting perspective, and it features the world''s most perfect machine. What else can I say?', '2007-12-28 00:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340203, 625339, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool perpective. It looks like the rocks are flowing away from the tower.</td>', 'Cool perpective. It looks like the rocks are flowing away from the tower.', '2007-12-28 00:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340207, 625084, 15690, '<td valign="top">Colorful but not distracting from the main subject.</td>', 'Colorful but not distracting from the main subject.', '2007-12-28 00:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340208, 624955, 83313, '<td valign="top">Neat looking glow. I would suppose there was not a lot of light to catch this with. The tilted horizon bothers me though, and really takes away from the image.</td>', 'Neat looking glow. I would suppose there was not a lot of light to catch this with. The tilted horizon bothers me though, and really takes away from the image.', '2007-12-28 00:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
