(4340217, 624554, 83313, '<td valign="top">Other than a touch more sharpness, and some perspective correction of the wall on the right, this is pretty durn good.</td>', 'Other than a touch more sharpness, and some perspective correction of the wall on the right, this is pretty durn good.', '2007-12-28 00:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
