(4342280, 625692, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good concept, the gateway to the hidden city.  Very nice find with great coloring and textures.  You straightened the bottom, but the middle and top are tilted to the right.  Maybe it''s because you aren''t directly in front of the door, maybe because it''s really old and settling.  Good mysterious answer to the challenge.</td>', 'Good concept, the gateway to the hidden city.  Very nice find with great coloring and textures.  You straightened the bottom, but the middle and top are tilted to the right.  Maybe it''s because you aren''t directly in front of the door, maybe because it''s really old and settling.  Good mysterious answer to the challenge.', '2007-12-29 00:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
