(4342338, 624988, 76430, '<td valign="top">The tiny size is going to cost you points.  Also the composition with a face growing out of the blonde woman''s chin.  If this is your first challenge don''t get discouraged.  A few minor improvements and it would be very good.</td>', 'The tiny size is going to cost you points.  Also the composition with a face growing out of the blonde woman''s chin.  If this is your first challenge don''t get discouraged.  A few minor improvements and it would be very good.', '2007-12-29 01:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342355, 625785, 76430, '<td valign="top">With an <a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=532436" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">agapantha </a>in bloom I''ll guess this is Australia.  Great capture and stop motion on the butterfly.  Nicely done on the background.  It marginally fits the challenge, but it''s worth a good score.  I don''t like the spider web lines, but it does show very good detail.</td>', 'With an agapantha in bloom I''ll guess this is Australia.  Great capture and stop motion on the butterfly.  Nicely done on the background.  It marginally fits the challenge, but it''s worth a good score.  I don''t like the spider web lines, but it does show very good detail.', '2007-12-29 01:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342359, 625084, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great coloring.  It looks slanted a bit and the focus on the man looks a bit off, though it''s better on the print behind him.  Also his attention appears to be to the camera''s right.  Is he posing for many photographers?</td>', 'Great coloring.  It looks slanted a bit and the focus on the man looks a bit off, though it''s better on the print behind him.  Also his attention appears to be to the camera''s right.  Is he posing for many photographers?', '2007-12-29 01:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
