(4342731, 624837, 48697, '<td valign="top">Cool picture and I like the composition. I do feel that the picture lacks some contrast and could benifit from a little noise reduction.</td>', 'Cool picture and I like the composition. I do feel that the picture lacks some contrast and could benifit from a little noise reduction.', '2007-12-29 09:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342739, 624352, 48697, '<td valign="top">I like the use of lines from the two buildings. The courtyard seems a bit dark, probably becuase there was such a range of tones in the shot you had to struggle to balance the highlights and shadows.  It also appears to be suffering a bit from motion blur or being OOF.</td>', 'I like the use of lines from the two buildings. The courtyard seems a bit dark, probably becuase there was such a range of tones in the shot you had to struggle to balance the highlights and shadows.  It also appears to be suffering a bit from motion blur or being OOF.', '2007-12-29 09:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342742, 624711, 48697, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the lines in this shot and I like the perspective used.  I also feelthe motion blur from the train adds to the photo, well done!</td>', 'Nice use of the lines in this shot and I like the perspective used.  I also feelthe motion blur from the train adds to the photo, well done!', '2007-12-29 09:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
