(4343798, 625519, 87252, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think there are a few things wrong here, the composition needs thinking about, maybe a profile shot of the statue''s face would have been better. The background is too busy, there''s no particular point of focus. Also maybe if this shot was taken in the early evening there might have been a softer light to create more contrast, as it is the overcast day creates quite a harsh, flat light.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think there are a few things wrong here, the composition needs thinking about, maybe a profile shot of the statue''s face would have been better. The background is too busy, there''s no particular point of focus. Also maybe if this shot was taken in the early evening there might have been a softer light to create more contrast, as it is the overcast day creates quite a harsh, flat light.', '2007-12-29 20:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4343861, 625594, 88010, '<td valign="top">Quite nice, I would like a little more detail showing in the building, maybe a little dodge and burn here and there. I''m new here so I''m not sure that''s allowed in basic editing. Nice composition!!</td>', 'Quite nice, I would like a little more detail showing in the building, maybe a little dodge and burn here and there. I''m new here so I''m not sure that''s allowed in basic editing. Nice composition!!', '2007-12-29 20:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4343862, 625409, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective . I can "feel" the height, good job.</td>', 'Nice perspective . I can "feel" the height, good job.', '2007-12-29 20:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4343863, 624977, 88010, '<td valign="top">I can''t say it''s "hidden", but it is a nice photo.</td>', 'I can''t say it''s "hidden", but it is a nice photo.', '2007-12-29 20:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4343864, 624711, 88010, '<td valign="top">Bravo, hidden and well taken. Love the movement!!</td>', 'Bravo, hidden and well taken. Love the movement!!', '2007-12-29 20:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4343865, 625360, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very nice!! Love the gray tones and then BAM, color all framed in. Beautiful job.</td>', 'Very nice!! Love the gray tones and then BAM, color all framed in. Beautiful job.', '2007-12-29 20:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4343866, 625084, 88010, '<td valign="top">His face is a little grainy and not quite sharp, but the background is. Wonderful colors and contrast.</td>', 'His face is a little grainy and not quite sharp, but the background is. Wonderful colors and contrast.', '2007-12-29 20:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344019, 624871, 48697, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, love the composition and the mystic feel this has.</td>', 'Very cool shot, love the composition and the mystic feel this has.', '2007-12-29 21:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344030, 625572, 48697, '<td valign="top">Nice b&amp;w,I really like this shot. Good range of tones and appealing composition, nicely done!</td>', 'Nice b&w,I really like this shot. Good range of tones and appealing composition, nicely done!', '2007-12-29 21:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344045, 625543, 48697, '<td valign="top">Very different PP on this shot, not to my taste but creative and adds an ominous tone to the shot.</td>', 'Very different PP on this shot, not to my taste but creative and adds an ominous tone to the shot.', '2007-12-29 21:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344055, 625558, 48697, '<td valign="top">Seems like this is lacking contrast. Almost appears tone-mapped with the tones being flattened.</td>', 'Seems like this is lacking contrast. Almost appears tone-mapped with the tones being flattened.', '2007-12-29 21:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344069, 624432, 48697, '<td valign="top">Cool subtle shot, I think the B&amp;W really adds to the feel of this shot.  I also feel that the motion blur of the people and cars helps convey the "tucked away" feel of the building from the hustle and bustle of everyday life. Well thought out and well done!</td>', 'Cool subtle shot, I think the B&W really adds to the feel of this shot.  I also feel that the motion blur of the people and cars helps convey the "tucked away" feel of the building from the hustle and bustle of everyday life. Well thought out and well done!', '2007-12-29 21:58:27.000000', NULL, 1);
