(4344158, 625409, 48697, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and I love the distortion. Well done!</td>', 'Great perspective and I love the distortion. Well done!', '2007-12-29 22:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344161, 625204, 48697, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot! Love the tone and the misty feel, excellent!</td>', 'Very cool shot! Love the tone and the misty feel, excellent!', '2007-12-29 22:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344168, 625519, 48697, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to suffer from being oof and being over exposed.</td>', 'This shot seems to suffer from being oof and being over exposed.', '2007-12-29 22:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344280, 625594, 81362, '<td valign="top">This image draws me in effortlessly -- I want to know more about the man and the place. Nice b&amp;w conversion, wonderful composition. I think it would be a bit stronger with that trace of sky cropped out, but I like it a lot anyway.</td>', 'This image draws me in effortlessly -- I want to know more about the man and the place. Nice b&w conversion, wonderful composition. I think it would be a bit stronger with that trace of sky cropped out, but I like it a lot anyway.', '2007-12-29 23:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344281, 625785, 81362, '<td valign="top">Something like this would not only be missed by most people casually visiting a park but also by most photographers trying to capture an image. The wonderful timing and colors reveal your skill.</td>', 'Something like this would not only be missed by most people casually visiting a park but also by most photographers trying to capture an image. The wonderful timing and colors reveal your skill.', '2007-12-29 23:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344283, 625204, 81362, '<td valign="top">The somber mood of a foggy time is nicely enhanced by the yellowish color. Having the bridge reflection contribute a set of circles adds an interesting and unexpected bit of geometry. Nice composition.</td>', 'The somber mood of a foggy time is nicely enhanced by the yellowish color. Having the bridge reflection contribute a set of circles adds an interesting and unexpected bit of geometry. Nice composition.', '2007-12-29 23:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344284, 625587, 81362, '<td valign="top">Striking and unsettling, with black and white conversion an excellent choice -- and well-executed too.</td>', 'Striking and unsettling, with black and white conversion an excellent choice -- and well-executed too.', '2007-12-29 23:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344286, 624603, 81362, '<td valign="top">The repeating pattern of scalloped arches and columns gives a nice visual rhythm to the image. It would be a safe bet that the people there mostly don''t notice it because they fail to look up. Good eye to capture this one.</td>', 'The repeating pattern of scalloped arches and columns gives a nice visual rhythm to the image. It would be a safe bet that the people there mostly don''t notice it because they fail to look up. Good eye to capture this one.', '2007-12-29 23:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344287, 624227, 81362, '<td valign="top">Delicate and cold like winter, the sense of a hidden place is enhanced by the limited range of tones and the delicate crisp foliage.</td>', 'Delicate and cold like winter, the sense of a hidden place is enhanced by the limited range of tones and the delicate crisp foliage.', '2007-12-30 00:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344288, 625183, 81362, '<td valign="top">Undulating arches seem smooth -- almost lush -- with the warm yellow tones and central lightness making this hidden area seem extra special. Nice exposure to maintain so much detail in what looks like a challenging shot.</td>', 'Undulating arches seem smooth -- almost lush -- with the warm yellow tones and central lightness making this hidden area seem extra special. Nice exposure to maintain so much detail in what looks like a challenging shot.', '2007-12-30 00:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344289, 625624, 81362, '<td valign="top">The repeating upright gate elements and corresponding shadows liven up an otherwise somber setting. Interesting mood, almost like something from the middle ages.</td>', 'The repeating upright gate elements and corresponding shadows liven up an otherwise somber setting. Interesting mood, almost like something from the middle ages.', '2007-12-30 00:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344290, 625179, 81362, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture of pavers that are textured but that shine with a sense of smoothness as well. Excellent impression of an out-of-the way place in some city (feels like something in Europe - I hope you tell us the location).</td>', 'Interesting capture of pavers that are textured but that shine with a sense of smoothness as well. Excellent impression of an out-of-the way place in some city (feels like something in Europe - I hope you tell us the location).', '2007-12-30 00:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344291, 624837, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of a geometric pattern that most patrons of the library would miss - hidden, but not invisible.</td>', 'Very nice capture of a geometric pattern that most patrons of the library would miss - hidden, but not invisible.', '2007-12-30 00:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344293, 624546, 81362, '<td valign="top">The vivid colors and perspective-line pattern of the terracotta army are strong and striking, earning an 8 from me. Consider cropping away the sky and trees for a possibly more powerful image.</td>', 'The vivid colors and perspective-line pattern of the terracotta army are strong and striking, earning an 8 from me. Consider cropping away the sky and trees for a possibly more powerful image.', '2007-12-30 00:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344294, 625298, 81362, '<td valign="top">Those porch conversations really to knit the city together in a way that most people don''t see. I remember reading that looking sideways is a good exercise for seeing things differently. Your capture looking sideways down the row illustrates the point.</td>', 'Those porch conversations really to knit the city together in a way that most people don''t see. I remember reading that looking sideways is a good exercise for seeing things differently. Your capture looking sideways down the row illustrates the point.', '2007-12-30 00:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344295, 624711, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good choice of shutter speed to make the train almost vanish, and nice composition of arched rectangles contrasting with the linear platform and track area.</td>', 'Good choice of shutter speed to make the train almost vanish, and nice composition of arched rectangles contrasting with the linear platform and track area.', '2007-12-30 00:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344296, 625360, 81362, '<td valign="top">Bridge supports often remind me of cathedrals and castles. This shot makes me look for a knight with a lance to come striding across the grass.</td>', 'Bridge supports often remind me of cathedrals and castles. This shot makes me look for a knight with a lance to come striding across the grass.', '2007-12-30 00:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344297, 624692, 81362, '<td valign="top">This is another one that I marked lower at the start and then came back to rate higher after looking again. The red tones, nearly empty wide street, and cars driving away from the viewer combine well to convey a sense of lonesome-city-in-the-middle-of-the-night that stays hidden from those who keep sensible hours.</td>', 'This is another one that I marked lower at the start and then came back to rate higher after looking again. The red tones, nearly empty wide street, and cars driving away from the viewer combine well to convey a sense of lonesome-city-in-the-middle-of-the-night that stays hidden from those who keep sensible hours.', '2007-12-30 00:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344298, 624554, 81362, '<td valign="top">I like the warm tones and preservation of details. Definitely looks like a place worth visiting -- where is it and what was for dinner?</td>', 'I like the warm tones and preservation of details. Definitely looks like a place worth visiting -- where is it and what was for dinner?', '2007-12-30 00:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344299, 625783, 81362, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet the city fathers wish this could be hidden better. What an interesting find. Love the skull and crossbones as well as the mix of colors.</td>', 'I''ll bet the city fathers wish this could be hidden better. What an interesting find. Love the skull and crossbones as well as the mix of colors.', '2007-12-30 00:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344300, 625484, 81362, '<td valign="top">What an interesting combination of blues, from almost black to turquoise. The shining reflections and dark people-figures combine to make this a very interesting piece.</td>', 'What an interesting combination of blues, from almost black to turquoise. The shining reflections and dark people-figures combine to make this a very interesting piece.', '2007-12-30 00:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344301, 624977, 81362, '<td valign="top">On vacation I want to drink in the city, and now you show how possible that is. Limiting the colors to blues and yellows keeps this composition simple and artistic. Nicely done.</td>', 'On vacation I want to drink in the city, and now you show how possible that is. Limiting the colors to blues and yellows keeps this composition simple and artistic. Nicely done.', '2007-12-30 00:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344302, 624684, 81362, '<td valign="top">I like the choice to make this diagonal. Along with the glass and metal elements, it gives a high-tech high-energy sensation to the image.</td>', 'I like the choice to make this diagonal. Along with the glass and metal elements, it gives a high-tech high-energy sensation to the image.', '2007-12-30 00:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344303, 625588, 81362, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well,and good use of black and white.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well,and good use of black and white.', '2007-12-30 00:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344304, 625751, 81362, '<td valign="top">I know of a few cities that have natural waterfalls tucked in quiet places. The artificial waterfalls in city gardens are often smaller and less natualized. I like how soothing the greens feel.</td>', 'I know of a few cities that have natural waterfalls tucked in quiet places. The artificial waterfalls in city gardens are often smaller and less natualized. I like how soothing the greens feel.', '2007-12-30 00:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344305, 624871, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice to have such a still surface to make the reflections crisp. Moonlight is often difficult to get right. I hope you reveal the length of the exposure.</td>', 'Nice to have such a still surface to make the reflections crisp. Moonlight is often difficult to get right. I hope you reveal the length of the exposure.', '2007-12-30 00:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344306, 624429, 81362, '<td valign="top">Sometimes it pays to get up early. This reminds me of pictures from the 1930''s. Good work.</td>', 'Sometimes it pays to get up early. This reminds me of pictures from the 1930''s. Good work.', '2007-12-30 00:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344307, 624448, 81362, '<td valign="top">The foggy setting and that barbed wire atop the fence lead to thoughts about prisons - whether physical and imposed by others or mental and imposed by self. Good art makes you think.</td>', 'The foggy setting and that barbed wire atop the fence lead to thoughts about prisons - whether physical and imposed by others or mental and imposed by self. Good art makes you think.', '2007-12-30 00:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344308, 624504, 81362, '<td valign="top">Using black and white for a historic setting is a good choice. The wreath on the door, bare tree limbs, and cloud pattern make this feel like winter.</td>', 'Using black and white for a historic setting is a good choice. The wreath on the door, bare tree limbs, and cloud pattern make this feel like winter.', '2007-12-30 00:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344309, 625358, 81362, '<td valign="top">Maybe it should have stayed hidden. What a hoot. I hope you tell us what that is.</td>', 'Maybe it should have stayed hidden. What a hoot. I hope you tell us what that is.', '2007-12-30 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344310, 624710, 81362, '<td valign="top">Is that set of shadows the city skyline? It sure took me a while to see it. Nicely done.</td>', 'Is that set of shadows the city skyline? It sure took me a while to see it. Nicely done.', '2007-12-30 00:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344330, 625088, 81362, '<td valign="top">Although this one doesn''t leap to the top of the competition in this challenge, the yellow-brown weeds, gravel, and gritty sidewalk have an honest kind of artistic merit that I didn''t get at first glance.</td>', 'Although this one doesn''t leap to the top of the competition in this challenge, the yellow-brown weeds, gravel, and gritty sidewalk have an honest kind of artistic merit that I didn''t get at first glance.', '2007-12-30 00:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344331, 625308, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like rain could fall any second. A faster shutter speed might have helped keep the reeds sharper despite the breeze. In the context of this challenge, I wonder if the hidden swamp is hidden in a city. Hope you let us know.</td>', 'Looks like rain could fall any second. A faster shutter speed might have helped keep the reeds sharper despite the breeze. In the context of this challenge, I wonder if the hidden swamp is hidden in a city. Hope you let us know.', '2007-12-30 00:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344332, 624213, 81362, '<td valign="top">Small is almost an understatement when the motorcycle handles almost don''t fit between the fence and the wall. Intersting, but grim feeling.</td>', 'Small is almost an understatement when the motorcycle handles almost don''t fit between the fence and the wall. Intersting, but grim feeling.', '2007-12-30 00:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344335, 625384, 81362, '<td valign="top">A good bed and breakfast tucked away in a hidden corner of a city can be a treasure. Nice to know at least one exists in Phoenix.</td>', 'A good bed and breakfast tucked away in a hidden corner of a city can be a treasure. Nice to know at least one exists in Phoenix.', '2007-12-30 00:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344358, 624504, 86379, '<td valign="top">nice tones in this, and very sharp</td>', 'nice tones in this, and very sharp', '2007-12-30 00:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344359, 625751, 86379, '<td valign="top">makes me want to find this ''secret garden''. nice image.</td>', 'makes me want to find this ''secret garden''. nice image.', '2007-12-30 00:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344360, 625718, 86379, '<td valign="top">i just love big beautiful trees. nice job :)</td>', 'i just love big beautiful trees. nice job :)', '2007-12-30 00:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344362, 624432, 86379, '<td valign="top">cool image.</td>', 'cool image.', '2007-12-30 00:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344365, 625360, 86379, '<td valign="top">i really like this. and the title is great. nice job.</td>', 'i really like this. and the title is great. nice job.', '2007-12-30 00:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344366, 625064, 86379, '<td valign="top">wow i really like the look of the sky in this. great shot!</td>', 'wow i really like the look of the sky in this. great shot!', '2007-12-30 00:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344368, 625624, 86379, '<td valign="top">nice image</td>', 'nice image', '2007-12-30 01:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344369, 625572, 86379, '<td valign="top">i love the tones in this....very nice</td>', 'i love the tones in this....very nice', '2007-12-30 01:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344418, 624903, 61396, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Applying restoration techniques reveal that it''s about an Alpine town buried/hidden in snow after an avalanche, so it meets the challenge description to the letter.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Applying restoration techniques reveal that it''s about an Alpine town buried/hidden in snow after an avalanche, so it meets the challenge description to the letter.', '2007-12-30 02:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344642, 624603, 47483, '<td valign="top">i think this is red fort agra.</td>', 'i think this is red fort agra.', '2007-12-30 08:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344751, 625231, 61396, '<td valign="top">Lovely complementary colors. Can you share the an untold story behind the office-chair, the chain and the coca cola can?</td>', 'Lovely complementary colors. Can you share the an untold story behind the office-chair, the chain and the coca cola can?', '2007-12-30 10:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344785, 625538, 81362, '<td valign="top">The image communicates "city" clearly, and I like the choice of black/white to highlight the repetition of wheels and fenders without the distraction of differing colors. "Hidden" is less obvious, but would make for an interesting conversation.</td>', 'The image communicates "city" clearly, and I like the choice of black/white to highlight the repetition of wheels and fenders without the distraction of differing colors. "Hidden" is less obvious, but would make for an interesting conversation.', '2007-12-30 11:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344794, 625231, 81362, '<td valign="top">People somtimes complain of feeling chained to their desk chair, but I hadn''t thought about a desk chair being locked to a post on the street. Thanks for translating "seccia", which helps me better understand the image.</td>', 'People somtimes complain of feeling chained to their desk chair, but I hadn''t thought about a desk chair being locked to a post on the street. Thanks for translating "seccia", which helps me better understand the image.', '2007-12-30 11:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344845, 625623, 12998, '<td valign="top">had potential, buildings are crooked, looks off balanced with open space in between buildings.</td>', 'had potential, buildings are crooked, looks off balanced with open space in between buildings.', '2007-12-30 11:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345197, 625623, 81362, '<td valign="top">This has a nice exposure for the lights and the reflections. Unfortunately, the horizon is slightly tilted, which normally might be hard to notice but, in this case, the tall buildings and their reflections are positioned to exaggerate the impact. Just a tiny rotation (allowed in basic editing rules) might have allowed a higher score.</td>', 'This has a nice exposure for the lights and the reflections. Unfortunately, the horizon is slightly tilted, which normally might be hard to notice but, in this case, the tall buildings and their reflections are positioned to exaggerate the impact. Just a tiny rotation (allowed in basic editing rules) might have allowed a higher score.', '2007-12-30 15:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345205, 624988, 81362, '<td valign="top">It is easy to agree that calm spots tend to be hidden and hard to find in big cities. I wonder if this would be stronger if taken from a little higher camera position, maybe also moving over to the left a little to show more of the second woman''s face and less of the bright window, which distracts from the peaceful light of the candles.</td>', 'It is easy to agree that calm spots tend to be hidden and hard to find in big cities. I wonder if this would be stronger if taken from a little higher camera position, maybe also moving over to the left a little to show more of the second woman''s face and less of the bright window, which distracts from the peaceful light of the candles.', '2007-12-30 15:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345465, 625592, 81362, '<td valign="top">This image just begs to be at the top of a human interest story explaning the odd justaposition of holidy decorations and cemetary markers in a center divider among broad streets.</td>', 'This image just begs to be at the top of a human interest story explaning the odd justaposition of holidy decorations and cemetary markers in a center divider among broad streets.', '2007-12-30 17:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345468, 625543, 81362, '<td valign="top">The tiled roof shelters a home hidden at the bottom of a foggy hill in a city. Is the color from streetlights/moonlight or is there some post-processing at work here too?</td>', 'The tiled roof shelters a home hidden at the bottom of a foggy hill in a city. Is the color from streetlights/moonlight or is there some post-processing at work here too?', '2007-12-30 17:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345469, 625572, 81362, '<td valign="top">With cell phones taking over, those booths are getting hard to find. You picked a good time of day for this, with an absence of people suggesting a little-visited place.</td>', 'With cell phones taking over, those booths are getting hard to find. You picked a good time of day for this, with an absence of people suggesting a little-visited place.', '2007-12-30 17:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345470, 625064, 81362, '<td valign="top">Sharp and colorful, with steam rising up to hide part of the view. The image doesn''t convey "city" very clearly, so I''m thinking it must be well-hidden.</td>', 'Sharp and colorful, with steam rising up to hide part of the view. The image doesn''t convey "city" very clearly, so I''m thinking it must be well-hidden.', '2007-12-30 17:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345471, 625084, 81362, '<td valign="top">You''d have to travel far from my city to find this fellow. Very colorful and captured without distracting elements. Because the color tones are light and bright, you might consider using something other than white for the edges.</td>', 'You''d have to travel far from my city to find this fellow. Very colorful and captured without distracting elements. Because the color tones are light and bright, you might consider using something other than white for the edges.', '2007-12-30 17:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345472, 625611, 81362, '<td valign="top">The patterns of the lines are so striking, I almost missed the cat. Definitely "hidden".</td>', 'The patterns of the lines are so striking, I almost missed the cat. Definitely "hidden".', '2007-12-30 17:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345473, 625539, 81362, '<td valign="top">Interesting architectural details and a peaceful evening setting that must have been quite a challenge to capture so well.</td>', 'Interesting architectural details and a peaceful evening setting that must have been quite a challenge to capture so well.', '2007-12-30 17:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345474, 625217, 81362, '<td valign="top">These little places, "hidden" along side streets, give cities much of their individual flavor. Do tell us what city this is.</td>', 'These little places, "hidden" along side streets, give cities much of their individual flavor. Do tell us what city this is.', '2007-12-30 17:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345476, 624955, 81362, '<td valign="top">The slope of the hills and the slightly askew horizon make it seem like you have captured the curvature of the earth. Could be a poster for this city.</td>', 'The slope of the hills and the slightly askew horizon make it seem like you have captured the curvature of the earth. Could be a poster for this city.', '2007-12-30 17:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345477, 625442, 81362, '<td valign="top">Although an obscure (perhaps "hidden") setting in some city, this image has elements that feel universal to newer cities everywhere, and make it seem strangely familiar.</td>', 'Although an obscure (perhaps "hidden") setting in some city, this image has elements that feel universal to newer cities everywhere, and make it seem strangely familiar.', '2007-12-30 17:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345479, 625259, 81362, '<td valign="top">After appreciating the graphic on the wall and the use of motion blur to "hide" the walking child, I came back to look again and found myself noticing and appreciating the mix of colors and texture on the sidewalk. Interesting combination.</td>', 'After appreciating the graphic on the wall and the use of motion blur to "hide" the walking child, I came back to look again and found myself noticing and appreciating the mix of colors and texture on the sidewalk. Interesting combination.', '2007-12-30 17:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345480, 625558, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice balance of building and sky/clouds. Gardens at the back of buildings can remain hidden from most people. Thanks for revealing it to us.</td>', 'Nice balance of building and sky/clouds. Gardens at the back of buildings can remain hidden from most people. Thanks for revealing it to us.', '2007-12-30 17:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345481, 625622, 81362, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal swath of grass between the broken stone, emblematic of the gentle power of nature gradually hiding an entire city over many years.</td>', 'I like the diagonal swath of grass between the broken stone, emblematic of the gentle power of nature gradually hiding an entire city over many years.', '2007-12-30 17:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345482, 624307, 81362, '<td valign="top">Pastel tones reflecting on the river seem fitting for a city known for art.</td>', 'Pastel tones reflecting on the river seem fitting for a city known for art.', '2007-12-30 17:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345483, 625556, 81362, '<td valign="top">This looks like a place that I wouldn''t want to hang out in very long. Glad you got the picture. Hope you got away ok.</td>', 'This looks like a place that I wouldn''t want to hang out in very long. Glad you got the picture. Hope you got away ok.', '2007-12-30 17:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345484, 625378, 81362, '<td valign="top">When we glance at the hidden, unattractive back alleys and electric meters, out attention usually highlights just a couple of key aspects while the rest could just as easily be blurred and unnoticed. The lens baby effect imitates this well, which I appreciate somewhat to my surprise (I like many kinds of blur, but usually don''t like the lens baby results).</td>', 'When we glance at the hidden, unattractive back alleys and electric meters, out attention usually highlights just a couple of key aspects while the rest could just as easily be blurred and unnoticed. The lens baby effect imitates this well, which I appreciate somewhat to my surprise (I like many kinds of blur, but usually don''t like the lens baby results).', '2007-12-30 17:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345485, 625240, 81362, '<td valign="top">The dim light and snow make me feel cold just looking at this. I like the contrast of the mountain (harsh, figid, wild) with the town (flat, cozy, sheltered).</td>', 'The dim light and snow make me feel cold just looking at this. I like the contrast of the mountain (harsh, figid, wild) with the town (flat, cozy, sheltered).', '2007-12-30 17:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345486, 625693, 81362, '<td valign="top">Fascinating how the city lights come right to the edge of the former mine pit, unexpected in an urban setting and even more hidden at night. Nice balance of illumination.</td>', 'Fascinating how the city lights come right to the edge of the former mine pit, unexpected in an urban setting and even more hidden at night. Nice balance of illumination.', '2007-12-30 17:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345487, 625163, 81362, '<td valign="top">Selecting a vantage point that makes the rooftops into a series of stair steps against the clear blue sky makes this different from many other pictures of the city.</td>', 'Selecting a vantage point that makes the rooftops into a series of stair steps against the clear blue sky makes this different from many other pictures of the city.', '2007-12-30 17:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345488, 624811, 81362, '<td valign="top">Your title makes a good point: people make up a city, perhaps even more than the buildings do, so this fits the challenge in an unexpected way and provokes some thought.</td>', 'Your title makes a good point: people make up a city, perhaps even more than the buildings do, so this fits the challenge in an unexpected way and provokes some thought.', '2007-12-30 17:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345490, 625019, 81362, '<td valign="top">I am glad you preserved detail of the firefighter''s coat despite the relatively bright sky. An outline figure might have been easier and more iconic, but would not communicate the sadness nearly as well.</td>', 'I am glad you preserved detail of the firefighter''s coat despite the relatively bright sky. An outline figure might have been easier and more iconic, but would not communicate the sadness nearly as well.', '2007-12-30 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345491, 625770, 81362, '<td valign="top">Cars in motion can generate some interesting effects. The wheels looking like woven baskets is one I haven''t seen before and is fun. I''ll bet this would score better if the background had more urban elements.</td>', 'Cars in motion can generate some interesting effects. The wheels looking like woven baskets is one I haven''t seen before and is fun. I''ll bet this would score better if the background had more urban elements.', '2007-12-30 17:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345492, 624903, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice use of focal light for dramatic impact. Expecting an urban theme, I first got itchy imagining this fellow crawling through fiberglass insulation. On revisiting the image, it looks like a tunnel through snow/ice. The ambiguity adds interest.</td>', 'Nice use of focal light for dramatic impact. Expecting an urban theme, I first got itchy imagining this fellow crawling through fiberglass insulation. On revisiting the image, it looks like a tunnel through snow/ice. The ambiguity adds interest.', '2007-12-30 17:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345494, 625339, 81362, '<td valign="top">Keeping the rocky foreground prominent gives us a glimpse of what a fallen soldier might have seen while trying to attack the tower. Looks pretty isolated now, making me wonder what used to be there to defend.</td>', 'Keeping the rocky foreground prominent gives us a glimpse of what a fallen soldier might have seen while trying to attack the tower. Looks pretty isolated now, making me wonder what used to be there to defend.', '2007-12-30 17:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345495, 625186, 81362, '<td valign="top">Sometimes even the clouds above have clouds above them. I like the contrast of dark and light, but I would expect many DPC voters to award low scores for depending on the title to connect with the challenge topic.</td>', 'Sometimes even the clouds above have clouds above them. I like the contrast of dark and light, but I would expect many DPC voters to award low scores for depending on the title to connect with the challenge topic.', '2007-12-30 17:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345496, 624352, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like these plants don''t get much winter light, making for a somber theme in the center despite the warm surrounding indoor lights. Also looks like a candidate site to practice HDR approaches (when not required to stick with basic editing).</td>', 'Looks like these plants don''t get much winter light, making for a somber theme in the center despite the warm surrounding indoor lights. Also looks like a candidate site to practice HDR approaches (when not required to stick with basic editing).', '2007-12-30 17:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345497, 625813, 81362, '<td valign="top">The absence of interior lights and the invisibility of rooftops beyond the eves combine to make this look like a flat facade instead of an actual building, perhaps fitting for an image where the theme is artificial lighting that is hidden during the day.</td>', 'The absence of interior lights and the invisibility of rooftops beyond the eves combine to make this look like a flat facade instead of an actual building, perhaps fitting for an image where the theme is artificial lighting that is hidden during the day.', '2007-12-30 17:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345498, 625187, 81362, '<td valign="top">Because the rider is distant and dark, it is hard for the eye to immediately grasp his direction of travel, so the viewer must rely on the normal rules about flow of traffic for each side of the road (it took me a while to remember that different countries handle that differently). I wish that the image itself could have had some visual clues (other than the title) to help me anticipate the approaching impact of transition from rural to city.</td>', 'Because the rider is distant and dark, it is hard for the eye to immediately grasp his direction of travel, so the viewer must rely on the normal rules about flow of traffic for each side of the road (it took me a while to remember that different countries handle that differently). I wish that the image itself could have had some visual clues (other than the title) to help me anticipate the approaching impact of transition from rural to city.', '2007-12-30 17:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345507, 624440, 81362, '<td valign="top">What a striking find of art juxtaposed with the mundane. Having a different background for each rectangle is a bonus. Then there is the puzzel of what could be narrow enough to navigate on the skinny side of the double yellow line. Good catch all around.</td>', 'What a striking find of art juxtaposed with the mundane. Having a different background for each rectangle is a bonus. Then there is the puzzel of what could be narrow enough to navigate on the skinny side of the double yellow line. Good catch all around.', '2007-12-30 17:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345516, 624537, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good choice of unnatural processing to go with the unnatural decorations -- an interesting bit of residential pop art.</td>', 'Good choice of unnatural processing to go with the unnatural decorations -- an interesting bit of residential pop art.', '2007-12-30 17:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345523, 625409, 81362, '<td valign="top">Hidden along the back of these buildings, the fire escapes make an interesting pattern of repeating metal lines. You captured the feeling of height well enough to make me feel a little dizzy.</td>', 'Hidden along the back of these buildings, the fire escapes make an interesting pattern of repeating metal lines. You captured the feeling of height well enough to make me feel a little dizzy.', '2007-12-30 17:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345528, 624618, 81362, '<td valign="top">Well composed with the curved tracks dividing the dark trees and brush from the brighter slope on the other side. Is this hidden in some part of a city?</td>', 'Well composed with the curved tracks dividing the dark trees and brush from the brighter slope on the other side. Is this hidden in some part of a city?', '2007-12-30 17:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345538, 625127, 81362, '<td valign="top">The isolated building on a narrow sunlit ridge feels all the more hidden because of the multiple layers of shades of blue extending out as far as the eye can see. I imagne the lack of obvious connection to "city" will make many vote on the lower side of the scale.</td>', 'The isolated building on a narrow sunlit ridge feels all the more hidden because of the multiple layers of shades of blue extending out as far as the eye can see. I imagne the lack of obvious connection to "city" will make many vote on the lower side of the scale.', '2007-12-30 17:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345541, 625519, 81362, '<td valign="top">Quiet city parks often serve as hiding places for sculpture. I wish we could see more of the Gandhi figure.</td>', 'Quiet city parks often serve as hiding places for sculpture. I wish we could see more of the Gandhi figure.', '2007-12-30 17:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345550, 625692, 81362, '<td valign="top">I like the range of colors as well as the combination of shapes. Looks like the street slopes down to the left, which gives an intersting semi-off-balance efect to the image. Nice find.</td>', 'I like the range of colors as well as the combination of shapes. Looks like the street slopes down to the left, which gives an intersting semi-off-balance efect to the image. Nice find.', '2007-12-30 17:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345557, 624432, 81362, '<td valign="top">The jumble of traffic and pedestrians contribute to hiding the Royal Society building. They help this meet the challenge, but I have a feeling of irritation at not being able to have an unobstructed view up the narrow opening -- perhaps the point you are making.</td>', 'The jumble of traffic and pedestrians contribute to hiding the Royal Society building. They help this meet the challenge, but I have a feeling of irritation at not being able to have an unobstructed view up the narrow opening -- perhaps the point you are making.', '2007-12-30 17:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345618, 624955, 37104, '<td valign="top">This picture is a little unbalanced. If you showed both sides of the city, it might have been nicer.</td>', 'This picture is a little unbalanced. If you showed both sides of the city, it might have been nicer.', '2007-12-30 18:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345633, 624711, 37104, '<td valign="top">The ''ol Orange/Blue line... and the second DC Metro shot of the challenge! Represent!!<br/>You did a nice job, btw! Great use of long exposure, nice colors, good shot.</td>', 'The ''ol Orange/Blue line... and the second DC Metro shot of the challenge! Represent!!You did a nice job, btw! Great use of long exposure, nice colors, good shot.', '2007-12-30 18:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345634, 624575, 37104, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Very Glass Menagerie to me. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Very Glass Menagerie to me. Well done.', '2007-12-30 18:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345636, 624871, 37104, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Very MC to me and interesting as well.</td>', 'Cool shot. Very MC to me and interesting as well.', '2007-12-30 18:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345638, 625783, 37104, '<td valign="top">This shot is way too cluttered to me, but the awesome bold colors save it.</td>', 'This shot is way too cluttered to me, but the awesome bold colors save it.', '2007-12-30 18:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345643, 624903, 37104, '<td valign="top">I hope the discovery is a portal to John Malkovich''s head.</td>', 'I hope the discovery is a portal to John Malkovich''s head.', '2007-12-30 18:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345647, 624837, 37104, '<td valign="top">Very cool angle! The colors are too washed out unfortunately...</td>', 'Very cool angle! The colors are too washed out unfortunately...', '2007-12-30 18:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345736, 625624, 71244, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2007-12-30 19:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345759, 625440, 81362, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the geometric composition with the curved stairs and arched ceiling setting off the darker lines of walkways, handrails, and escalators. Those casual eating areas are not featured in magazines, but make up the hidden heart of a city.</td>', 'I enjoy the geometric composition with the curved stairs and arched ceiling setting off the darker lines of walkways, handrails, and escalators. Those casual eating areas are not featured in magazines, but make up the hidden heart of a city.', '2007-12-30 19:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345762, 625023, 81362, '<td valign="top">Definitely hidden, with a deep blue sky (whether from using a filter on camera or adjusting in post processing), and a relaxing looking place - although one that looks far away from any city.</td>', 'Definitely hidden, with a deep blue sky (whether from using a filter on camera or adjusting in post processing), and a relaxing looking place - although one that looks far away from any city.', '2007-12-30 19:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345765, 625178, 81362, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the first thought I have is to wonder how long it will take for someone to put text into that opening in the sky and turn it into a cartoon-like thought-baloon. This is a stretch for me to connect with the challenge description, but I guess it could fit if you envision heaven as a hidden city of gold up there somewhere.</td>', 'Sorry, but the first thought I have is to wonder how long it will take for someone to put text into that opening in the sky and turn it into a cartoon-like thought-baloon. This is a stretch for me to connect with the challenge description, but I guess it could fit if you envision heaven as a hidden city of gold up there somewhere.', '2007-12-30 19:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345770, 624575, 81362, '<td valign="top">Interesting ghost-like effect of a semi-transparent smoker who perhaps has to hide to light up (and who hastens his journey toward death by doing so). I hope you reveal how you accomplished this.</td>', 'Interesting ghost-like effect of a semi-transparent smoker who perhaps has to hide to light up (and who hastens his journey toward death by doing so). I hope you reveal how you accomplished this.', '2007-12-30 19:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345773, 625436, 81362, '<td valign="top">OK, a little town hidden downstairs with the model railroad set up. Wish the depth of field was greater so less of the detail would be lost in blur.</td>', 'OK, a little town hidden downstairs with the model railroad set up. Wish the depth of field was greater so less of the detail would be lost in blur.', '2007-12-30 19:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345780, 624744, 81362, '<td valign="top">A simple wooden cross near a wrecked car implies a sad tale of loss and sorrow. The table and metal stool complicate the picture, making me want to hear more about the real story.</td>', 'A simple wooden cross near a wrecked car implies a sad tale of loss and sorrow. The table and metal stool complicate the picture, making me want to hear more about the real story.', '2007-12-30 19:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345788, 625347, 81362, '<td valign="top">This image has so much going on that I have a hard time letting my eye concentrate on the two salesmen. With such a crowd, it must have been difficult to simplify the background for any of the mutliple interesting subjects. Sometimes it is possible to get down low and isolate an object of interest against the sky. Unclear whether that would have been realistic here. Let us know what they are selling.</td>', 'This image has so much going on that I have a hard time letting my eye concentrate on the two salesmen. With such a crowd, it must have been difficult to simplify the background for any of the mutliple interesting subjects. Sometimes it is possible to get down low and isolate an object of interest against the sky. Unclear whether that would have been realistic here. Let us know what they are selling.', '2007-12-30 20:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345791, 624777, 81362, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Kauai, although the vegitation might not be right. I''ll be interested in hearing a clarification of the "city" connection.</td>', 'Reminds me of Kauai, although the vegitation might not be right. I''ll be interested in hearing a clarification of the "city" connection.', '2007-12-30 20:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345796, 625718, 81362, '<td valign="top">The warm tones of a sun low in the sky give this a comfortable feeling, with the long shadows and vacant bench sending an invitation to relax. Is this a park hidden in a city?</td>', 'The warm tones of a sun low in the sky give this a comfortable feeling, with the long shadows and vacant bench sending an invitation to relax. Is this a park hidden in a city?', '2007-12-30 20:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345814, 624384, 81362, '<td valign="top">Pausing for a moment or two for these beautiful animals to move might have yielded a nice shot of two deer in an urban/surburban setting. Although they overlap in this image, the title is an awkward stretch and unfortunately not funny. Perhaps I should not be so literal, but the truth is that congenital deformities are real enough to not be a laughing matter.</td>', 'Pausing for a moment or two for these beautiful animals to move might have yielded a nice shot of two deer in an urban/surburban setting. Although they overlap in this image, the title is an awkward stretch and unfortunately not funny. Perhaps I should not be so literal, but the truth is that congenital deformities are real enough to not be a laughing matter.', '2007-12-30 20:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4345816, 625644, 81362, '<td valign="top">This gives me a sense of the setting, but I wonder if a more artistic image lurks inside waiting to be discovered. For an example of what I am imagining, consider sharpening a little, and maybe cropping the upper part just above that wooden railing near the water and the sides to just where the ramp begins to come up -- which would give emphasis to the shadows, planks, and water while taking away a number of elements that seem distracting to my eye.</td>', 'This gives me a sense of the setting, but I wonder if a more artistic image lurks inside waiting to be discovered. For an example of what I am imagining, consider sharpening a little, and maybe cropping the upper part just above that wooden railing near the water and the sides to just where the ramp begins to come up -- which would give emphasis to the shadows, planks, and water while taking away a number of elements that seem distracting to my eye.', '2007-12-30 20:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347197, 625588, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones and contrast.</td>', 'Very nice tones and contrast.', '2007-12-31 08:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
