(4352194, 624352, 70514, '<td valign="top">This is why I am happy to not live in a big city.  Still a great natural frame and I love the subtle light.</td>', 'This is why I am happy to not live in a big city.  Still a great natural frame and I love the subtle light.', '2008-01-02 00:32:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352198, 625178, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  I love how you make it look like she is opening up the sky.  I agree with what someone else said - it would be good to see a little more light on her too.  Cool idea.</td>', 'This is interesting.  I love how you make it look like she is opening up the sky.  I agree with what someone else said - it would be good to see a little more light on her too.  Cool idea.', '2008-01-02 00:33:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352212, 625519, 70514, '<td valign="top">It''s always better to stay true to yourself than be a sell out.  I love the fact that the bus is passing by.  Totally exemplifies the "hidden city" idea.  I say go back on a beautiful day and reshoot!  :)</td>', 'It''s always better to stay true to yourself than be a sell out.  I love the fact that the bus is passing by.  Totally exemplifies the "hidden city" idea.  I say go back on a beautiful day and reshoot!  :)', '2008-01-02 00:36:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352215, 625519, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the idea that you going with the perspective you used.  Unfortunately it looks like a branch is scratching his forehead lol.  I don''t think I totally understand the image you were trying to convey but what I do like seeing is the area surrounding the statue.  It looks like a very calm and serene place for a statue like this.</td>', 'I like the idea that you going with the perspective you used.  Unfortunately it looks like a branch is scratching his forehead lol.  I don''t think I totally understand the image you were trying to convey but what I do like seeing is the area surrounding the statue.  It looks like a very calm and serene place for a statue like this.', '2008-01-02 00:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352218, 624384, 67697, '<td valign="top">hehe great title.  I do find it amazing that the deer are just hanging out in the neighborhood like this.  Here, they keep getting moved out of their area because the trees are all being torn down to make way for project homes that no one really will care for.  Lovely isn''t it?<br/> <br/>Funny catch - I like it!</td>', 'hehe great title.  I do find it amazing that the deer are just hanging out in the neighborhood like this.  Here, they keep getting moved out of their area because the trees are all being torn down to make way for project homes that no one really will care for.  Lovely isn''t it? Funny catch - I like it!', '2008-01-02 00:40:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352221, 625204, 83416, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!!! One of those 9 was mine.</td>', 'Congratulations!!! One of those 9 was mine.', '2008-01-02 00:41:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352223, 625594, 83416, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!!! Awesome image.</td>', 'Congratulations!!! Awesome image.', '2008-01-02 00:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352263, 625594, 60495, '<td valign="top">Really fits the challenge and well done, congratulations on getting the Blue!</td>', 'Really fits the challenge and well done, congratulations on getting the Blue!', '2008-01-02 00:57:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352337, 625543, 30982, '<td valign="top">An eerie and foreboding feel.  Not at all cheeful and festive; I like that.</td>', 'An eerie and foreboding feel.  Not at all cheeful and festive; I like that.', '2008-01-02 01:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352339, 624352, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes, it may have had more punch if the courtyard had more light but that would kinda defeat the feel of a little sheltered and hidden courtyard surrounded by buildings which steal the light.</td>', 'Yes, it may have had more punch if the courtyard had more light but that would kinda defeat the feel of a little sheltered and hidden courtyard surrounded by buildings which steal the light.', '2008-01-02 01:34:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352347, 625770, 30982, '<td valign="top">I "got" it during the challenge, believe it or not.  I do think you''d have convinced more voters if at the edge of the greenery there was a hint of city.  Very good idea for the challenge!</td>', 'I "got" it during the challenge, believe it or not.  I do think you''d have convinced more voters if at the edge of the greenery there was a hint of city.  Very good idea for the challenge!', '2008-01-02 01:39:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352353, 625088, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very gray and dull - and very appropriate, methinks.  One generally doesn''t associate scenes like this with peppy blue-sky days so your presentation fits perfectly!</td>', 'Very gray and dull - and very appropriate, methinks.  One generally doesn''t associate scenes like this with peppy blue-sky days so your presentation fits perfectly!', '2008-01-02 01:41:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352364, 625594, 87387, '<td valign="top">i didnt realize the square crop, but it really works well for the scene ans adds to the balance. and i really love black and white, its my favorite type of photography</td>', 'i didnt realize the square crop, but it really works well for the scene ans adds to the balance. and i really love black and white, its my favorite type of photography', '2008-01-02 01:51:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352375, 624384, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well I thought I pretty interesting take on the challenge.  I wasn''t offended by the title, though I did think it was kinda funny.  Made me smile, anyway!  Nice that you have such lovely visitors.</td>', 'Well I thought I pretty interesting take on the challenge.  I wasn''t offended by the title, though I did think it was kinda funny.  Made me smile, anyway!  Nice that you have such lovely visitors.', '2008-01-02 02:03:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352378, 625378, 30982, '<td valign="top">The lensbaby works REALLY well for this - definitely adds the sense of hidden or secret.  Love the effect and the color.  It has that lovely late evening glow to it.</td>', 'The lensbaby works REALLY well for this - definitely adds the sense of hidden or secret.  Love the effect and the color.  It has that lovely late evening glow to it.', '2008-01-02 02:05:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352532, 625308, 79816, '<td valign="top">Thanks to those that commented. The location is a river running through Wexford town in Ireland. It does technically meet the challenge requirements, though I felt it was a ''squeeze'' as it was not obviously relating to a city.<br/> <br/>The shot looked better in my mind than what came out, I think another day where the sky was less cloudy (Hard here in winter!) would give a better result. <br/> <br/>I waited until the evening light hit the reeds, but there was so much wind I couldn''t get them sharp enough. It is a location I will return to, as I think the potential is there to get the shot I was really looking for.<br/> <br/>I am very new to photography, and am learning loads from this site.<br/> <br/>Thanks for looking!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-20 05:42:46.</i></td>', 'Thanks to those that commented. The location is a river running through Wexford town in Ireland. It does technically meet the challenge requirements, though I felt it was a ''squeeze'' as it was not obviously relating to a city. The shot looked better in my mind than what came out, I think another day where the sky was less cloudy (Hard here in winter!) would give a better result.  I waited until the evening light hit the reeds, but there was so much wind I couldn''t get them sharp enough. It is a location I will return to, as I think the potential is there to get the shot I was really looking for. I am very new to photography, and am learning loads from this site. Thanks for looking!', '2008-01-02 02:55:04.000000', '2008-08-20 06:42:46.000000', 0),
(4352534, 625023, 66635, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Where is this place?</td>', 'Beautiful!  Where is this place?', '2008-01-02 02:55:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352630, 625594, 49109, '<td valign="top">Well deserved ribbon for an outstanding image, congrats!</td>', 'Well deserved ribbon for an outstanding image, congrats!', '2008-01-02 03:34:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352733, 624710, 49109, '<td valign="top">You were robbed! If there''s a hidden city anywhere, it is in this shot!</td>', 'You were robbed! If there''s a hidden city anywhere, it is in this shot!', '2008-01-02 04:30:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352744, 624710, 68035, '<td valign="top">Sometimes is breaks your heart to know that you are right about something and I am truely sorry that my original comment turned out to be right and that you did suffer at the hands of speed voters.  Look at the difference between the average mark of those commenting and your overall average score and you will see that those who saw the hidden city truely loved this<br/> <br/>I have put this is in the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=624708&amp;page=27#4352712" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous Ribbons Of The Week</a> I hope that is OK<br/> <br/>A great shot</td>', 'Sometimes is breaks your heart to know that you are right about something and I am truely sorry that my original comment turned out to be right and that you did suffer at the hands of speed voters.  Look at the difference between the average mark of those commenting and your overall average score and you will see that those who saw the hidden city truely loved this I have put this is in the Posthumous Ribbons Of The Week I hope that is OK A great shot', '2008-01-02 04:32:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352746, 625204, 39427, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon with this other-worldly shot.  i gave a 9 too</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon with this other-worldly shot.  i gave a 9 too', '2008-01-02 04:32:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352748, 625594, 39427, '<td valign="top">congrats on the ribbon!  great to see this win, a very awesome documentary style shot</td>', 'congrats on the ribbon!  great to see this win, a very awesome documentary style shot', '2008-01-02 04:34:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352750, 625378, 68035, '<td valign="top">Happy New Year jack....Nice job playing with what I am guessing was a Christmas present.  This feels like I am falling through time to this alley (it made me think of the first terminator film)<br/> <br/>Love the fact that even with the new lens you have still managed to keep the colours so vibrant throught the shot</td>', 'Happy New Year jack....Nice job playing with what I am guessing was a Christmas present.  This feels like I am falling through time to this alley (it made me think of the first terminator film) Love the fact that even with the new lens you have still managed to keep the colours so vibrant throught the shot', '2008-01-02 04:37:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352756, 625409, 39427, '<td valign="top">congrats on the personal best!  i guess i was wrong with my composition comment :)</td>', 'congrats on the personal best!  i guess i was wrong with my composition comment :)', '2008-01-02 04:40:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352761, 624710, 39427, '<td valign="top">totally didn''t notice what was going on in this shot and i apologize for giving you a 5!  I need to be more careful...</td>', 'totally didn''t notice what was going on in this shot and i apologize for giving you a 5!  I need to be more careful...', '2008-01-02 04:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352766, 624710, 27482, '<td valign="top">That´s a shame Mark, think this one is severely underrated and should have scored much higher.  I do feel it could have been processed better, at least for my taste the image is pretty flat when it comes to b/w conversion and contrast, a simple levels adjustment would have made this shot pop much more off the screen.  Just PM me with your email adress if you want me to show you what I mean.  Anyway, congrats on a great shot!</td>', 'That´s a shame Mark, think this one is severely underrated and should have scored much higher.  I do feel it could have been processed better, at least for my taste the image is pretty flat when it comes to b/w conversion and contrast, a simple levels adjustment would have made this shot pop much more off the screen.  Just PM me with your email adress if you want me to show you what I mean.  Anyway, congrats on a great shot!', '2008-01-02 04:47:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352773, 624710, 69407, '<td valign="top">My apologies as well, Mark (if I may be so bold) - I didn''t see the shadows at all and I really took my time looking at this. In the Posthumous Ribbons thread I IMMEDIATELY saw it and felt quite the dolt! A brilliant idea and well done - if I could change the score I gave you now I most certainly would!</td>', 'My apologies as well, Mark (if I may be so bold) - I didn''t see the shadows at all and I really took my time looking at this. In the Posthumous Ribbons thread I IMMEDIATELY saw it and felt quite the dolt! A brilliant idea and well done - if I could change the score I gave you now I most certainly would!', '2008-01-02 04:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352776, 625178, 39427, '<td valign="top">I think i was too hung over from new years and I shouldn''t have been voting, as I did not realize what was happening in this photo when I left you my comment below.  I still gave you a 6 but would have scored higher if I had known what I was doing :(</td>', 'I think i was too hung over from new years and I shouldn''t have been voting, as I did not realize what was happening in this photo when I left you my comment below.  I still gave you a 6 but would have scored higher if I had known what I was doing :(', '2008-01-02 04:58:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4352819, 624710, 67258, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by EducatedSavage:</b></div><hr/><i> My apologies as well, Mark (if I may be so bold) - I didn''t see the shadows at all and I really took my time looking at this. In the Posthumous Ribbons thread I IMMEDIATELY saw it and felt quite the dolt! A brilliant idea and well done - if I could change the score I gave you now I most certainly would! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am just the same - I came back to the photo a few times duing voting and STILL didn''t see what was (in retrospect) so obviously there, yet when I viewed the thumbnail in the Posthumous thread I ''saw'' it straight away. Apologies from me for my low score.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-02 06:15:33.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by EducatedSavage: My apologies as well, Mark (if I may be so bold) - I didn''t see the shadows at all and I really took my time looking at this. In the Posthumous Ribbons thread I IMMEDIATELY saw it and felt quite the dolt! A brilliant idea and well done - if I could change the score I gave you now I most certainly would!   I am just the same - I came back to the photo a few times duing voting and STILL didn''t see what was (in retrospect) so obviously there, yet when I viewed the thumbnail in the Posthumous thread I ''saw'' it straight away. Apologies from me for my low score.', '2008-01-02 05:36:22.000000', '2008-01-02 06:15:33.000000', 0),
(4352834, 625572, 41554, '<td valign="top">Really a great pic. The sky/street perspective put the booth in evidence, and this has  agreat "urban" feel.<br/> <br/>Muito parabéns!</td>', 'Really a great pic. The sky/street perspective put the booth in evidence, and this has  agreat "urban" feel. Muito parabéns!', '2008-01-02 05:48:06.000000', NULL, 0),
