(4353540, 625572, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like this so much.   I love the nostalgic processing -- and that phone booth just adds so much character and interest!  congratulations on a well-deserved ribbon!<br/></td>', 'I really like this so much.   I love the nostalgic processing -- and that phone booth just adds so much character and interest!  congratulations on a well-deserved ribbon!', '2008-01-02 10:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4353544, 625693, 24454, '<td valign="top">Man!  This is really awesome.  What an interesting perspective.  It draws you in like a good story.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Man!  This is really awesome.  What an interesting perspective.  It draws you in like a good story. ', '2008-01-02 10:44:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4353546, 625259, 24454, '<td valign="top">Auuuugh. . . .I guess ya gotta love this not artsy bunch, huh?    Sometimes not so much.   I love this underrated photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Auuuugh. . . .I guess ya gotta love this not artsy bunch, huh?    Sometimes not so much.   I love this underrated photo! ', '2008-01-02 10:45:26.000000', NULL, 0),
