(4353996, 625360, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great shot, one of my top scorers. Congrats on top 10.</td>', 'Great shot, one of my top scorers. Congrats on top 10.', '2008-01-02 13:06:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4354093, 624384, 31403, '<td valign="top">the truth is that everything is real enough that we shouldn''t laugh at anything!<br/> <br/>Perhaps when you are as old and wise as some photographers you''ll stop laughing and perhaps smiling all together!<br/> <br/>o brother!<br/> <br/>The nice thing about deer becoming so acclimated to man is that we can get really close and take great photos now!<br/> <br/><a href="//flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/1588482415/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/1588482415/</a> <br/><a href="//flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/1588482213/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/1588482213/</a> <br/><a href="//flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/1589370210/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/1589370210/</a> <br/><a href="//flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/780392397/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/780392397/</a> <br/><a href="//flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/779814701/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/779814701/</a> <br/> <br/>etc.  So now I''m looking forward to seeing more of these from you too!  :-)<br/> <br/></td>', 'the truth is that everything is real enough that we shouldn''t laugh at anything! Perhaps when you are as old and wise as some photographers you''ll stop laughing and perhaps smiling all together! o brother! The nice thing about deer becoming so acclimated to man is that we can get really close and take great photos now! //flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/1588482415/ //flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/1588482213/ //flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/1589370210/ //flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/780392397/ //flickr.com/photos/digitalknight/779814701/  etc.  So now I''m looking forward to seeing more of these from you too!  :-) ', '2008-01-02 13:35:04.000000', NULL, 0),
