(4354895, 624546, 62318, '<td valign="top">Hidden City, looks like Forbidden City to me. :)<br/> <br/>Congrats on the 10 ten placement. While the army is the essence of the photograph, I love the way you used the trees as the foundation on either side as will as the lone individual to give the photo a little something special.</td>', 'Hidden City, looks like Forbidden City to me. :) Congrats on the 10 ten placement. While the army is the essence of the photograph, I love the way you used the trees as the foundation on either side as will as the lone individual to give the photo a little something special.', '2008-01-02 17:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4354929, 625204, 22538, '<td valign="top">Many thanks to everybody for their kind and helpful comments. It was surprising and exciting to see the score climbing from about 6.3 to nearly 7. Yes, there were both ups and downs on the way too. <br/>The morning itself was actually quite cold, both literally and colour temperature wise. The latter could be adjusted during raw conversion and then Photographic warm-up filter in CS2. Added some contrast too. And that was it.<br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Many thanks to everybody for their kind and helpful comments. It was surprising and exciting to see the score climbing from about 6.3 to nearly 7. Yes, there were both ups and downs on the way too. The morning itself was actually quite cold, both literally and colour temperature wise. The latter could be adjusted during raw conversion and then Photographic warm-up filter in CS2. Added some contrast too. And that was it.Thanks again.', '2008-01-02 18:01:28.000000', NULL, 0),
