(4362982, 624955, 64629, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, I don''t care what anybody says.Composition is great think much better than the whole city. Also lighting I think is perfect adds to the mood. As for the "tilt" if anything it may be lens abberation.People try to be helpful I''m not dogging that but let me say if you do not pick it apart and see the whole capture(in my mind how it''s supossed to be)this is VERY underated.<br/>But then again I never do too well here.<br/>Just writing because I found it encouraging when someone else saw what I did.</td>', 'This is a great shot, I don''t care what anybody says.Composition is great think much better than the whole city. Also lighting I think is perfect adds to the mood. As for the "tilt" if anything it may be lens abberation.People try to be helpful I''m not dogging that but let me say if you do not pick it apart and see the whole capture(in my mind how it''s supossed to be)this is VERY underated.But then again I never do too well here.Just writing because I found it encouraging when someone else saw what I did.', '2008-01-05 10:35:05.000000', NULL, 0),
