(4397122, 625587, 84075, '<td valign="top">I had a great time there. The Cambodians are truly kind and gentle people. The brutal regime of Pol Pot and the Khmer Rouge might have destroyed the country, but i found that their spirit is still alive and well. It seems now that the country are going through many positive changes. I am planning to go back there in few years time.</td>', 'I had a great time there. The Cambodians are truly kind and gentle people. The brutal regime of Pol Pot and the Khmer Rouge might have destroyed the country, but i found that their spirit is still alive and well. It seems now that the country are going through many positive changes. I am planning to go back there in few years time.', '2008-01-16 13:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4398428, 624710, 67697, '<td valign="top">I saw the city right away.  I love the use of light and shadow for this.  Very creative!  Congrats on the OOBIE!</td>', 'I saw the city right away.  I love the use of light and shadow for this.  Very creative!  Congrats on the OOBIE!', '2008-01-16 22:06:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4399367, 624710, 70689, '<td valign="top">Who cares about votes? I won an OOBIE, got my 15 minutes of fame, and so many nice comments. Once I noted <i>why</i> the vote was low (Never even crossed my mind that some people might not see the skyline), I had a great week looking at the score bouncing up and down. And I am really proud of the OOBIE. Such a great award to win.<br/> <br/>Thnx all for the kind words and all apologies accepted. :)</td>', 'Who cares about votes? I won an OOBIE, got my 15 minutes of fame, and so many nice comments. Once I noted why the vote was low (Never even crossed my mind that some people might not see the skyline), I had a great week looking at the score bouncing up and down. And I am really proud of the OOBIE. Such a great award to win. Thnx all for the kind words and all apologies accepted. :)', '2008-01-17 08:52:57.000000', NULL, 0),
